      "description": "Decouples @specd/core domain and application errors, services, and use cases from CLI-specific flags and command syntax by rewriting their messages in host-neutral terms while preserving structured metadata properties. Introduces centralized, command-aware hint resolution (resolveCliErrorHint) in @specd/cli so handleError, cliError, and custom repair guides render accurate command-specific hints on stderr and in structured json/toon output without mutating core error messages. Eliminates misleading hints such as --force appearing on specs validate when DependsOnOverwriteError is surfaced."
